---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout title="About Me" filename="about.htm">
  <h1>About Me</h1>

  <hr />

  <p>
    Hello and welcome to my About page! My name is <strong>[Your Name]</strong> and
    I'm excited to have you visit my website.
  </p>

  <h2>Who Am I?</h2>

  <p>
    I'm a web enthusiast who loves building things on the internet. This website is my
    personal space where I share articles, notes, and random thoughts about technology,
    design, and life.
  </p>

  <p>
    I created this site as a tribute to the early days of the World Wide Web — back when
    websites had personality, when <em>Microsoft FrontPage</em> was the tool of choice,
    and when "Under Construction" GIFs were everywhere!
  </p>

  <hr />

  <h2>My Interests</h2>

  <ul>
    <li>Web Development &amp; Design</li>
    <li>Retro Computing</li>
    <li>Digital Art</li>
    <li>Video Games</li>
    <li>Music Production</li>
  </ul>

  <hr />

  <h2>Contact Me</h2>

  <p>Want to get in touch? You can reach me through:</p>

  <ul>
    <li>📧 <a href="mailto:email@example.com">email@example.com</a></li>
    <li>💻 <a href="https://github.com">GitHub</a></li>
    <li>🐦 <a href="https://twitter.com">Twitter</a></li>
  </ul>

  <hr />

  <div class="fp-nav-bar">
    <a href={`${base}`} class="fp-nav-btn">◀ Back to Home</a>
    <a href={`${base}articles/`} class="fp-nav-btn">View Articles ▶</a>
  </div>

  <hr />

  <p style="text-align: center;">
    <em>Thanks for visiting! Feel free to sign my guestbook... just kidding, this isn't 2003! 😄</em>
  </p>
</Layout>
